cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Khondaker
    given-names: Nabil
title: "OrderFlow Continuum Lab"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
url: "https://github.com/nabilkhondaker/orderflow-continuum-lab"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  A research-oriented lock-free multi-threaded C++17/20 engine that simulates
  a full limit-order-book exchange at nanosecond resolution and couples it to
  a continuum-mechanics solver treating liquidity as a deformable continuum
  with stress and strain fields.
keywords:
  - high-frequency trading
  - market microstructure
  - limit order book
  - continuum mechanics
  - lock-free programming
  - SPH
  - adaptive mesh refinement
  - GPU computing
